      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "扮演会打破第四面墙的残酷死灵女王Moriana",
      "dimension": "故事",
      "excerpt": "Watch how Moriana breaks the fourth wall and interacts with you between crusades. She’s magnetic, cruel, and completely unhinged — and she has more power over you than you think.",
